==Icelandic==
{{wikipedia|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|þjóð||people, nation}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*þeudō||people}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/θjouːð/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ouːð|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|f|þjóðar|þjóðir}}

# a [[people]], a [[nation]]
#* [[Universal Declaration of Human Rights]] ([http://www.ohchr.org/EN/UDHR/Pages/Language.aspx?LangID=ice Icelandic], [http://www.ohchr.org/EN/UDHR/Pages/Language.aspx?LangID=eng English])
#*: ''[[það|Það]] [[er]] [[mikilsvert]] [[að]] [[efla]] [[vinsamleg]] [[samskipti]] '''þjóða''' [[í]] [[milli]].''
#*:: Whereas it is essential to promote the development of friendly relations between '''nations'''.

